  "name": "10T SRAM Cell — Sub-threshold / Near-Vt with Write-Assist",
  "description": "10-transistor SRAM for sub-threshold and near-Vt operation. Combines the 8T separate read port (eliminating read disturb) with write-assist PMOS (M_WA1, M_WA2) that boost internal nodes during write, restoring write margin lost at low VDD. Functions from 0.4V to 1.2V.",
  "category": "Memory",
  "technology": ["SKY130"],
  "keywords": ["10t sram", "10t", "10 transistor sram", "sub threshold sram", "near vt sram", "ultra low voltage sram", "sram 10t"],
